c.execute('update units set source_quality_notes=? where screening_unit_id=?',('Required original simulation preserved in pinned source archive. Root-relative libraries require an HTTP server at the extracted repository root, not opening standalone HTML. Runtime check covered initial rendering/field/chart and measurement samples, not full drag/drop parameter-inference experiment. No actual contestant dataset generated.','raw::326'))
c.execute('update units set source_quality_notes=? where screening_unit_id=?',('Preserved simulator ABB/simulation.js passes v*cos(gamma) for BOTH detector vx and vy and treats gamma input as radians despite degrees label. Runtime v=10,gamma=0 demonstrably gives [10,10,0], not [10,0,0]. Official key uses stationary-detector methods, which remain functional. Key 1027 rendered p5 prints f_min=5327.82 Hz for the far-right substitution, inconsistent with its own ~543.96 Hz extrema and reported f0~990 Hz. Source archive also contains identical bytes for Experimental_Solution 1.pdf and 2.pdf; canonical acoustic key is raw1027, not that mislinked archive PDF. No source repaired.','raw::327'))
